        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a patented 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging that combines heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard, stretch film, and custom wooden crates for fragile items. Each vehicle is secured on hydraulic ramp trailers with ratchet lashings and wheel chocks, and our GPS‑monitored fleet guarantees smooth handling throughout the 850 km journey.</p>
