        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I transport my car via Indian Railways through your service, and how does it work?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. We act as an authorized auto transport partner for Indian Railways. After securing your booking, we deliver the vehicle to the nearest rail siding, handle all railway documentation, and load the car onto a dedicated rail wagon. Upon arrival at the destination hub, our team unloads and hands over the vehicle, ensuring full insurance coverage throughout.</p>
