        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every shipment is covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance policy offering 100 % declared value protection. The policy covers accidental damage, theft, and natural hazards during transit. Clients receive a certificate of insurance before loading, and any claim is processed swiftly with transparent documentation.</p>
