        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is based on three transparent factors: the exact distance (approximately 850 km), the type and size of the vehicle, and any optional services such as premium packaging or expedited delivery. All taxes, GST, and insurance are itemised in the quote, so there are no hidden charges. The final invoice matches the quoted amount.</p>
