        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What types of vehicles can be moved using your hydraulic ramp trailers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our fleet accommodates a wide range of vehicles, from compact cars and luxury sedans to SUVs, vans, and even small trucks. The hydraulic ramp system supports vehicles up to 2.5 tonnes and 6 meters in length, with adjustable wheel chocks and high‑tensile lashings to secure any load safely.</p>
