        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Live GPS tracking lets you monitor your vehicle’s exact location, speed, and estimated arrival time from the moment it leaves Sivagiri until delivery. This transparency reduces anxiety, enables proactive communication, and ensures any route deviations are addressed instantly, reinforcing our zero‑scratch guarantee.</p>
