ural hazards during transit. Clients receive a certificate of insurance before loading, and any claim is processed swiftly with transparent documentation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is the pricing calculated for car transportation in Sivagiri and are there hidden fees?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Pricing is based on three transparent factors: the exact distance (approximately 850 km), the type and size of the vehicle, and any optional services such as premium packaging or expedited delivery. All taxes, GST, and insurance are itemised in the quote, so there are no hidden charges. The final invoice matches the quoted amount."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of vehicles can be moved using your hydraulic ramp trailers?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our fleet accommodates a wide range of vehicles, from compact cars and luxury sedans to SUVs, vans, and even small trucks. The hydraulic ramp system supports vehicles up to 2.5 tonnes and 6 meters in length, with adjustable wheel chocks and high‑tensile lashings to secure any load safely."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does real‑time GPS tracking benefit me during the Sivagiri to hub journey?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Live GPS tracking lets you monitor your vehicle’s exact location, speed, and estimated arrival time from the moment it leaves Sivagiri until delivery. This transparency reduces anxiety, enables proactive communication, and ensures any route deviations are addressed instantly, reinforcing our zero‑scratch guarantee."}}]}
